5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to understand the staffing reality before we pick a plan. Who else is looking at the roster books?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m checking the two pilots from eight years ago. We keep repeating mistakes without reading the closure reports.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am reviewing the joint operators' committee minutes. I need to see who else must approve these schemes before we commit to any dates.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m looking at the capital ledger balances. I need to see what we actually have left after the recent cuts.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m checking the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city! I want to see if the crowding complaints match what actually happens on the street.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I’m also reviewing the crew establishment and maintenance contract. I need to know if we have the spare capacity to actually run whatever we choose.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I’m also checking the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. I want to see what actually stuck versus what got reverted.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am also reviewing contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I need to know what the ground might hide before we trust any delivery date.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’m also checking the ticketing contractor fees. I need to see if those costs are eating up the money we think we have.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I’m also checking journey audits on where minutes go! I want to know if we’re fixing the wrong part of the trip.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’m not choosing anything yet. I need to see the actual numbers before I can say if any of these plans are even staffable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
